{
  "$defs": {
    "ExposureDepth": {
      "description": "看到了，还是点开了。两者的转化意义完全不同。",
      "enum": [
        "impression",
        "detail"
      ],
      "title": "ExposureDepth",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ExposureEvent": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "「这个学生真的看见过这条机会」（Spec §17.6 的唯一真实来源）。\n\n**刻意不并进** :class:`ActionType`。``ActionEvent`` 是 VGA 与 B8 的载体\n（``verified_growth`` / ``evidence_ids`` / ``approval_receipt_id``），曝光一样\n都没有；混进去会污染 ``GET /actions``、广场的「已收藏/已报名」派生与\n``vga-summary``——而 §17.1 明写 **VGA 不奖励点击、收藏、报名或忙碌本身**。\n\n它**带 student_id**：按设计只活在学生私有域，只经 ``roles=(STUDENT,)``\n的端点写入，绝不出现在任何 ``/v1/insights/*`` 响应里（由测试钉死）。",
      "properties": {
        "depth": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExposureDepth",
          "default": "impression"
        },
        "event_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Event Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "occurred_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Occurred At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "period": {
          "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}_(FALL|WINTER|SPRING|SUMMER)$",
          "title": "Period",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "student_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Student Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "subject_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Subject Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "surface": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExposureSurface"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event_id",
        "student_id",
        "subject_id",
        "surface",
        "occurred_at",
        "period"
      ],
      "title": "ExposureEvent",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ExposureSurface": {
      "description": "曝光发生在哪个入口。Plaza-to-Action 只数广场那一半。",
      "enum": [
        "plaza",
        "for_you"
      ],
      "title": "ExposureSurface",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://campuspath.invalid/schema/ExposureBatch.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "前端攒一批再发。逐条发会把最高频的浏览动作变成最高频的网络请求。",
  "properties": {
    "events": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExposureEvent"
      },
      "maxItems": 200,
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Events",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "student_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Student Id",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "student_id",
    "events"
  ],
  "title": "ExposureBatch",
  "type": "object"
}
